<title>USA: UOL Publishing license Voxware technology.</title>
<headline>UOL Publishing license Voxware technology.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UOL Publishing Inc said Wednesday it licensed Voxware Inc's voice conferencing platform  to deliver online real-time voice-based interactive classes.</p>
<p>UOL, a publisher of Web-based courseware for the academic and corporate education markets, said it also plans to leverage Voxware's RT29HQ voice compression technology and its telephony network toolkit.</p>
<p>Voxware develops advanced speech and audio technologies and communications products.</p>
</text>
